{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/4ffb8e284d997cf5d92a4d138fa7ae04.avif?t=1751536143\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lust Sisters</strong> \ud83d\udd1e is a 3D adult visual novel with point-and-click exploration and light puzzle elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/3_2_aion1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751536143\" /></div>After a chance encounter with a nun on a rainy road, you find yourself stuck overnight in a secluded monastery. What starts off innocent quickly turns seductive \u2014 and strangely controlled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/3_2_aion11-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751536143\" /></div>While searching for tools to fix your car, you\u2019re asked to help around the monastery\u2026 but each favor pulls you deeper into the sisters\u2019 sensual routines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/0170ff74085aa508358b0ddea62fae9f.avif?t=1751536143\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The line between hospitality and obsession starts to blur. Is this just a bizarre stop on your journey \u2014 or something you\u2019ll never escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/6_2_aion1-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751536143\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/00adf125cd9ac00c144f620a8cb567b0.avif?t=1751536143\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 <strong>Repair &amp; Escape</strong> \u2013 Find tools and parts to fix your car and plan your way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc9e <strong>Relationship System</strong> \u2013 Your connection with each nun affects how much they\u2019re willing to help\u2026 and it may decide your ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle &amp; Explore</strong> \u2013 Solve tasks, explore the monastery, and unlock new scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26ea <strong>Church Secrets</strong> \u2013 Uncover the hidden rituals and twisted rules behind the sisters\u2019 way of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd1e <strong>Adult Content</strong> \u2013 Enjoy spicy scenes that change depending on how you play.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718530?t=1751536143","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3718530?t=1751536143","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/acf8dc6da3c13a9a3acc4943b907fff36af62fbd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751536143","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/acf8dc6da3c13a9a3acc4943b907fff36af62fbd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751536143","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"This game contains content not appropriate for all ages, or for viewing at work: sexual acts, nudity. The game graphically depicts sex. All characters in the game are over the age of 18."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718530/extras/4ffb8e284d997cf5d92a4d138fa7ae04.avif?t=1751536143\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_p